        "explain": "A scientific fact: present simple in both clauses, so ‘it boils’, not ‘it will boil’."
      },
      {
        "use": "Fact",
        "before": "If you",
        "after": "red and yellow, you get orange.",
        "hint": "(mix)",
        "answers": [
          "mix"
