        "display": "mix",
        "explain": "The if-clause takes the present simple. With ‘you’ there is no -s: ‘you mix’."
      },
      {
        "use": "Fact",
        "before": "Ice",
        "after": "if you leave it in the sun.",
        "hint": "(melt)",
        "answers": [
